--- query
query round_with_an_unknown_option() {
    match { $x: N } return { round($x.f, places: 2) as r }
}

--- expect error: T71: `round` has no option `places`; it admits `digits`

--- query
query sqrt_over_a_string() {
    match { $x: N } return { sqrt($x.k) as r }
}

--- expect error: T72: `sqrt` needs a number, got String

--- query
query round_with_float_digits() {
    match { $x: N } return { round($x.f, digits: 1.5) as r }
}

--- expect error: T7: `round`'s `digits` is an I64, I32 or U32, got F64
